:: Farm Woodland Tend Apologise
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"I-I'm so sorry," you say, staring stubbornly at the ground. "I didn't mean to look."
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		"My apologies," you say, lowering your gaze. "That was rude of me."
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"Yeah, that was low of me," you admit. "Sorry."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Fine. Sorry," you say, though the edge in your voice lingers.
	<<case "special">>
		"Sorry," you say with a crooked smile. "I really should've had more self-control."
	<<default>>
		"Sorry," you say, averting your eyes. "That was rude of me."
<</switch>>
<br><br>

"Just don't look again," Alex says. <<He>> saws through the log, but keeps <<his>> legs together until <<hes>> finished.
<br><br>

<<Hes>> still blushing when the branch falls to the floor, and <<he>> climbs back down.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Woodland]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Farm Woodland Tend Tease
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"C-cute underwear," you blurt out with an embarrassed giggle.
	<<case "docile">>
		"They're... really cute," you admit softly.
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		"You've got good taste in underwear," you say. "They suit you."
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"Nice underwear," you tease. "Bit of a shame to hide them under there."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Cute," you say. "Didn't expect you to wear something that flattering."
	<<case "special">>
		"Cute underwear," you say with a grin. "Hard not to comment."
	<<default>>
		"You've got good taste in underwear," you say.
<</switch>>
<<promiscuity1>>

Alex's blush deepens. <<He>> continues sawing the log, but keeps <<his>> legs tight together, <<his>> skirt bunched between them, until <<hes>> finished.
<br><br>

<<Hes>> still blushing when the branch falls to the floor, and <<he>> climbs back down.
<br><br>

