:: Farm Woodland Safe
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"M-me too," you say, voice going soft in the hush beneath the branches.
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		"Me too," you say. "It's peaceful here."
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"Yeah, I get it," you say. "It's easier to breathe out here."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"It's quiet enough to be useful," you say. "That helps."
	<<case "special">>
		"Me too," you admit. "It's the sort of place that makes the rest of the world shut up."
	<<default>>
		"It calms me down too," you say.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

"They feel protective," Alex says. "I'll fall asleep if I'm not careful.

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	I should head indoors before I catch a chill."
<<elseif $farm_work.alex is "relax">>
	Not such a bad thing. I'm on break anyway."
<<else>>
	That's enough rest though. I should get back to work."
<</if>>
<<He>> walks towards the cottage.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


