:: Farm Woodland Safe Indoors
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"Y-you shouldn't stay out here at night," you say. "You'll catch a cold."
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		"You should head indoors," you say. "Before this lovely atmosphere gives you a chill."
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		"What are you doing out here at this hour?" you ask. "You'll freeze if you keep this up."
	<<case "cruel">>
		"Go inside before you make yourself sick," you say. "This isn't worth shivering over."
	<<case "special">>
		"You should head in," you say. "The woods will still be here tomorrow."
	<<default>>
		"You should go inside," you say gently. "It's getting too cold out here."
<</switch>>
<br><br>

Alex nods. "You're right," <<he>> says. "There's just a nice atmosphere here. Time to enjoy it later."
<br><br>

Together, you walk through the woodland and return to the cottage.
